    <string name="health_info_title">About battery health</string>
    <string name="health_info_body">BatStats estimates your battery\'s full capacity from what it records: the charge that flowed in or out during a charge or discharge, divided by how far the level moved.\n\nEvery estimate comes with a confidence. High: the level moved at least 40 percent and the charge counter reported nearly all the time. Medium: at least 20 percent. Low: at least 10 percent. Shorter sessions give no estimate.\n\nThe capacity shown combines the estimates of the newest 50 sessions and weighs confident ones more, so one odd session can\'t move it much.\n\nHealth compares that capacity with the design capacity: the one you set in Settings or, with root, the one the battery reports. A new battery can read above 100 percent. It is an estimate, not a lab test.</string>
